<title>UK: TABLE-Shield moves into red for the year.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Shield moves into red for the year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.06 loss	    vs 1.48</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.33 loss	    vs 0.21</p>
<p> Turnover		   5.75		   vs 5.83</p>
<p>NOTE - Shield said a decline in infectious disease sales affected group turnover. The company said sales in the first quarter of the current year had been in line with expectations, but increased development spending meant it was not yet profitable on a monthly basis.</p>
<p>Full company name - Shield Diagnostics Plc Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
